/**
 * Servings of a mass, each read as count × mass; a range of servings reads its lower end:
 *   - "2 cápsulas de 750 mg", "4 cápsulas x 750 mg", "4 cápsulas 750mg", "1 cacito de 5 g";
 *   - the mass marked as each: "2 cápsulas (750 mg cada una)", "4 gummies (1 g each)";
 *   - a count, a mass, a serving word: "2 500mg capsules", "half a 5g scoop";
 *   - a count "de" a mass: "2 de 750 mg", "4 diarias de 750 mg";
 *   - a count, then a mass each: "4 al día, 1 g cada una".
