 * WS3-19 (ruling D-23): the reference change values table is generated from the decided rows and holds no stand-in;
 * a change between two results is named only beyond the marker's RCV, between two results from EVA's laboratory with
 * the same recorded collection method; a marker without a complete RCV gets no change wording at all.
